WEBVTT

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.230
Good morning, my lord.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.100
Morning.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.400
It is quite a pleasant morning, isn't it?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.370
Where is Miss Pecorine?

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:47.740
Oh, Peco?

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.620
The morning market.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:28.270
Menu 1 <b>A Walk on the Gourmet Side 
~Curiosity Is the Best Bouquet Garni~</b>

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:34.440
Karyl! Breakfast is ready!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.330
I'll be right down!

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.700
Let's eat!

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:43.290
They're fresh eggs from Yasuko's, 
gathered just this morning!

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:49.240
They really are. 
Her eggs have never let us down!

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.660
They're rich and extremely delicious.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:56.040
They're from a type of 
chicken called a silkie.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.640
Huh...

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:02.010
Oh, I almost forgot.
 The storeroom roof was leaking.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.740
Leave it to me.

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.410
Oh? Are you sure?

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.180
Yuuki has gotten a lot better 
with that sort of thing.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.350
He's had to repair things lots of times.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.700
This was just an old building,

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.860
but it's now a house 
we've grown attached to.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:27.560
Hey, Karyl, you left your vegetables again.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.500
Wh-What's wrong with that?

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:33.000
It's not good to be picky.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.470
Bad girl!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.000
Hey! Cut that out!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.390
Don't treat me like a little kid!

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.050
By the way...

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:43.550
I got this at the Guild Association the other day.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:47.440
Good work!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.690
You completed your quest.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:50.600
Yes.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.750
Miss Karin, please take these.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.790
Oh, my!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.980
I picked lots of them.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.790
They look delicious!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.370
Oh, yes! I don't know if it'll 
suffice to return the favor, but...

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.380
I couldn't offer this as a quest

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:09.100
because our information on it 
was questionable, but...

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.750
Drops of the Sea?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.380
Miss Karin thought it might be 
of use to the Gourmet Guild,

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.510
so she gave me this.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.120
She said it's a map leading 
to a legendary seasoning.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.560
Really?! Let's do it!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.310
What the heck is this?

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:30.110
I don't want to go on some fool's errand.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.070
Karyl!

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.700
Listen to me!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.630
There might be a legendary seasoning!

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.330
That alone makes it more than worth trying!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.720
Uh, it's one thing to <i>say </i>
it's worth it, but...

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.610
Don't you remember?

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.500
What's the goal of the Gourmet Guild?

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:58.820
To seek out all the delicious 
food of this world!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.030
Love... you...

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:01.690
I love you...

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.330
Yeah, as if!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.140
Dummy! Woof, woof, woof!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:10.070
M-My lord!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.150
Wow, you're from Landosol, eh?

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.490
Yes!

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.200
Do you recognize anything on that map?

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:23.710
Hmm... Can't say much just from seeing this.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.190
I suppose not.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.400
There are a lot of monsters around here.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.160
Be careful out there, you hear?

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.680
Okay!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.940
Our masters...

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.640
...went on a quest?

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.720
Yeah, Karin told us

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.310
they went lookin' for some 
kinda legendary seasoning!

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:45.250
So that's why we haven't 
seen them in a while.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.920
I wonder what kind of tasty food 
they're gonna make for us!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.890
Man, I can't take it!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.530
Master! Gimme another!

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.800
But you said this seasoning 
was "legendary," right?

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:04.490
Uh...

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.720
Yeah, that's true...

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.020
Don't worry!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.070
You know our masters!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.340
They won't come back without it!

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.020
You got that right!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.090
'Cause they're the Gourmet Guild!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.640
<i>Dear Elder.</i>

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.480
<i>I had no idea the world was so beautiful</i>

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.400
<i>and so full of mystery.</i>

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.030
<i>A beautiful forest of coral...</i>

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.630
<i>Fish that swim through the sky...</i>

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:45.430
<i>Under the gentle sunlight, we are now...</i>

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.630
Wait up!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.880
How crazy is this?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.930
Whee!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.600
<i>...lost. Respectfully yours.</i>

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.830
I'm so hungry!

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.880
Why did this happen?!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.910
I just want to sleep in a warm bed!

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.570
Miss Karyl, this is a forest of coral.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.290
There are no beds.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.410
Selfish!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.850
Shut up!

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:28.130
Now, now, Karyl. No need to be so on edge.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.840
I'll cook some fish right away.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.880
No! I'm sick of fish!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.240
Day in and day out, it's fish, fish, fish!

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.620
Give me a break!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:40.270
Meat! I want real meat!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.280
A bug!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:48.950
I'm done... I wanna go home...

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.940
Poor thing.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:54.410
Right! Food is the source of all energy!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.860
I'll go look for some meat for Karyl!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.650
In a forest this size,

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.550
there must be some animals worth eating.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.240
Right, Yuuki?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:19.050
Nice going, Yuuki! 
Let's have those for dinner tonight!

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:20.300
Oh, gosh, I'm drooling...

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:24.430
Crap! Crap! Crap!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.930
Come on!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.440
<b>PriConne</b>

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.490
What a shame. I was so close...

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.890
Too bad.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:36.110
I doubt we can catch them when 
they're running that fast.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:39.240
There must be a better way...

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.070
Nice going, Yuuki!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:51.860
A strategy that makes use of 
whatever it is that makes you

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.440
such a hot target for wild animals!

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.540
Yay! It worked, Yuuki!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.960
Is this...

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.480
I slept great!

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.270
Huh? Did we have a pelt like this?

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.150
It's so soft and warm.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.710
Karyl!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.330
Are you awake? It's time to eat!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.090
<b>PriConne</b>

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.470
Go on and eat your fill of meat!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.600
Let's eat!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.080
This is bliss!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.490
It's very fragrant.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:02.030
I love how crispy the skin is!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.160
There's still plenty more.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.190
Really?!

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.980
Being so hungry was making 
me think negatively,

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.630
but I feel a lot better now!

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:14.870
Let's find our way out of here 
and get those Drops of the Sea!

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.360
Yeah!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.660
That's very reassuring, Miss Karyl.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:20.990
Just leave it all to me!

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.580
Did the smell attract them here?

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.960
Everyone, be careful!

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.840
Boy, do they ever look creepy.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.850
Like furball ghosts with 
nothing but a mouth...

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:54.220
Hey... Just what kind of 
meat is that, anyway?

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.290
What the heck did you feed to us?!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.210
Don't tell me it's from 
these furball mouth gho—

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:07.630
Karyl?!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.090
What is this? My body is...

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:14.630
This isn't good! Everyone, protect Karyl!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:16.100
Okay!

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.000
Yuuki!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.290
Wait, you don't think the meat 
from those monsters is poisono—

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:35.360
I... I was sure I cleaned all that out...

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.550
No!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:42.560
I don't want to die in such a stupid way!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.820
I can't believe you ate 
these monsters' meat.

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:13.180
It's good that you have youth on your side.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.110
I feel alive again.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.730
The numbness has subsided.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.950
How crazy was that?

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.870
This tea is made by brewing 
the corals of this forest.

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:30.950
Works well, doesn't it?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.730
Yes! Thank you so much!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.660
Been a long time since I 
saw any other people here.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:42.880
Tell me, have you all come here in 
search of the Drops of the Sea?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:43.730
Yes.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.840
We followed this map.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.630
Ah...

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.400
This brings back memories.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:54.780
You know what it is?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:59.200
I was also in a guild once, long ago.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.650
I went on all sorts of adventures.

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:07.060
The Drops of the Sea marked 
on this map was one of them.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.390
So the Drops of the Sea really exist?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.660
They sure do.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.070
Yay!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:19.930
Whew! Thank goodness this 
wasn't all a waste of time!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:22.160
You're such a worrywart, Karyl.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.780
You're just too reckless!

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.020
That's a lovely locket.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.150
I can see that it's precious to you.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.480
Oh, just a habit.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.480
Oh, would you stop being so weird?

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:33.190
Is this your guild?

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.010
They were all a bunch of useless losers.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.010
It's legendary so it must be delicious!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.710
Anyway,

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.310
It's legendary!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.450
do you know what the Drops of the Sea are?

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.380
Huh?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.890
The truth is... we don't 
even know what they are yet.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.840
No matter, no matter.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.130
That's how young adventurers ought to be.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:00.070
The Drops of the Sea

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:04.390
are tears shed by the island 
turtle when it lays its eggs.

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:05.750
A turtle?!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.080
But don't take it lightly.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:13.050
The minerals that seep out from the 
mountains on the island turtle's shell

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:18.750
and the deep sea waters create a 
harmony that is simply exquisite.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.730
Just imagining it makes me feel 
like my cheeks might melt!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:28.440
Once you're through this coral forest, 
you'll find a place called the White Wasteland.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:32.330
Beyond that lies the place where 
the island turtle lays its eggs.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.840
The White Wasteland?

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:37.980
We were never able to get 
past it back in the day.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.940
Should you really be giving us 
such priceless information?

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.630
It's all right.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:46.780
I'll get my hands on the 
Drops of the Sea someday.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:47.660
For sure!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:56.360
This battered old map is a copy of the map 
we etched into the coral forest long ago.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.650
I'll show you.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.260
Here it is.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.030
How pretty!

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:11.220
Now we can get the map!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.110
Yes!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.800
That should do it.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:28.030
Okay! All that's left is to head 
toward the Drops of the Sea!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.670
Mister, thank you so much for...

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.010
What?! What's going on?!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.720
Mister, what's happening?!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.410
Mister?

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.510
I knew it was too good to be true!

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:11.150
My sword...

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.060
Looks like physical attacks won't work!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.150
I'll just have to...

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:17.100
Please wait, Miss Karyl.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.910
The forms those monsters have taken...

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.260
Wait, are they the old man's...?

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.430
Let me handle this.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:33.820
My lord, if you would, please.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.520
Sure.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.780
Healing wind,

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:45.680
guide these frozen souls 
to their place of repose.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.090
It feels warm.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.050
Mister?

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:21.280
Now my long journey has 
finally come to an end.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.830
We never finished our journey,

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:34.010
but the time I spent with these three 
was more precious than any treasure.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:38.480
That's why I couldn't just 
leave my partners behind

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:43.740
after the poison of the coral 
forest turned them into monsters.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:50.910
I truly thank you for saving my partners.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:55.300
Aren't adventures fantastic?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:59.060
They make your blood boil 
and your flesh dance!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:04.840
You talk with your companions, 
argue at times,

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:07.400
and do silly things together.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:12.560
I wanted to keep adventuring 
with them forever.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.510
You should come with us!

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.020
Why not?

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.960
Even as ghosts, you can still 
go on more adventures!

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:22.900
Right?

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:25.790
Hmph!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:30.950
Don't think you can pass on so easily 
after you set us up like that!

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.720
You'd better prepare yourselves!

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:50.230
I pray a brilliant light 
will shine upon your path.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.290
We're going now, mister.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.130
Off we go in search of tasty foods!

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.340
Takeoff!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.200
Nice one!

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.720
What now? Should we turn back?

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.250
Let's go!

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:08.940
Yes!

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.690
That's the spirit!

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.700
I guess we have no choice!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.940
You'd better be ready!

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:24.130
Here I go!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:27.750
Princess Strike!

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:36.450
Go!

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.560
It's not laying eggs.

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.620
It's male!

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.050
Okay!

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:50.780
We're back...

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.570
I'm... I'm so tired.

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.450
You've had a very long journey.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:59.820
Well, the old man seemed content.

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:04.010
I sure didn't expect him to 
take off with so much vigor.

00:22:10.170 --> 00:22:11.830
I'm so hungry!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.480
Stupid jerk!

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:17.760
I'm never going on a crazy 
quest like that again!

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:22.770
Thank you for waiting so long.

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:29.680
Is this...

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:33.530
I had to use what was here, since we 
were away from the house for so long.

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:36.710
The vegetables I didn't finish...

00:22:37.130 --> 00:22:38.570
Well, come on!

00:22:38.910 --> 00:22:41.170
Let's eat!

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:33.700
Thank you for the meal!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Menu 2   <b>A Moody Cat's Hesitation 
~Antipasto in the Moonlight~</b>
